   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "During the War of the Spark Tezzeret opened the Planar Bridge atop it, stripping Jace of his Guildpact power and reducing the Chamber to rubble.",
   "cites": [
    "chamber-of-the-guildpact-e1",
    "war-e0"
   ],
   "links": [
    "https://mtg.wiki/page/Chamber_of_the_Guildpact#:~:text=the%20Chamber%20was%20catastrophically,Planar%20Bridge%20atop%20it",
    "https://scryfall.com/card/war/245/emergence-zone#:~:text=The%20Planar%20Bridge%20opened,Ravnica%27s%20endurance%20to%20rubble."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Nissa led a ritual at the ruins that resurrected Niv-Mizzet as the new Living Guildpact, and he incinerated Kefnet when the God-Eternal attacked.",
   "cites": [
    "chamber-of-the-guildpact-e2",
    "niv-mizzet-e14"
   ],
   "links": [
    "https://mtg.wiki/page/Chamber_of_the_Guildpact#:~:text=resurrecting%20Niv%2DMizzet%20as%20the%20new%20Living%20Guildpact",
    "https://mtg.wiki/page/Niv-Mizzet#:~:text=Upon%20his%20rebirth%2C%20the%20Firemind%20incinerated%20Kefnet"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Phyrexian invasion Vraska's forces destroyed the roof of the Chamber and Niv-Mizzet's seat.",
   "cites": [
    "one-and-the-same-e11",
    "chamber-of-the-guildpact-e3"
   ],
   "links": [
    "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/one-and-the-same#:~:text=delighting%20in%20crushing%20Niv%2DMizzet%27s%20seat",
